
pack.name=This Add-On adds several Origins and Classes with passive abilities to the game, in which you choose upon the start of your adventure. Created by r4isen1920.


origins.welcome_message=(Scroll down to see changelog)


origins.race.random.name=You'll be assigned to one of the following Origins listed below, only if it's available for use:
origins.race.random.description=You'll be assigned to a random available Origin.
origins.race.random.description_changed=Człowiek
origins.race.human.name=A regular human. Your ordinary Minecraft experience awaits.
origins.race.human.description=Merling
origins.race.merling.name=These natural inhabitants of the ocean are not used to being out of the water for too long.
origins.race.merling.description=Pajęczak
origins.race.arachnid.name=Their climbing abilities and the ability to trap their foes in spiderweb make the Arachnid perfect hunters.
origins.race.arachnid.description=Blazeborn
origins.race.blazeborn.name=Late descendants of the Blaze, the Blazeborn are naturally immune to the perils of the Nether.
origins.race.blazeborn.description=Avian
origins.race.avian.name=The Avian race has lost their ability to fly a long time ago. Now these peaceful creatures can be seen gliding from one place to another.
origins.race.avian.description=Fantom
origins.race.phantom.name=As half-human and half-phantom offspring, these creatures can switch between a Phantom and a normal form.
origins.race.phantom.description=Koci
origins.race.feline.name=With their cat-like appearance, the Feline scare creepers away. With the dexterity of cats, they always land safely on their feet.
origins.race.feline.description=Elytrian
origins.race.elytrian.name=Often flying around in the winds, Elytrians are uncomfortable when they don't have enough space above their head.
origins.race.elytrian.description=Enderian
origins.race.enderian.name=Born as sons and daughters of the Ender Dragon, Enderians are capable of teleporting but are vulnerable to water.
origins.race.enderian.description=Shulk
origins.race.shulk.name=Related to Shulkers, the bodies of the Shulk are outfitted with a protective shell-like skin.
origins.race.shulk.description=Lis
origins.race.kitsune.name=Foxes are, though weak in terms of vitality, utilize their innate spiritual abilities to hide and strengthen their power.
origins.race.kitsune.description=Slimecican
origins.race.slimecican.name=Part human, part slime. Very unpleasant to touch with your bare hands.
origins.race.slimecican.description=Starborne
origins.race.starborne.name=Narodzając się z gwiazd, jesteś bez przemocy, obsesję na punkcie gwiazd, tajemniczą i potencjalnie potężną osobą, która spadła z gwiazd w ten blokowy świat, w którym żyjemy.
origins.race.starborne.description=Inchling
origins.race.inchling.name=Descendants of the smallest tribe, these creatures are as nimble as their size.
origins.race.inchling.description=Pszczoła
origins.race.bee.name=Bees are cool. They fly, enjoy flowers, and die.
origins.race.bee.description=Piglin
origins.race.piglin.name=Dominant race of the Nether, these humanoid creatures uses their sheer brawn and boasts their gold.
origins.race.piglin.description=Elven
origins.race.elf.name=Elegant and agile beings with a deep connection to nature, skilled in archery, over which they have honed thanks to their great lifespan.
origins.race.elf.description=Voidwalker
origins.race.voidwalker.name=Born in the depths of a sinister realm, you have acquired the ability to manipulate and harness dark energies from within to harm others.
origins.race.voidwalker.description=Wróżbita
origins.race.diviner.name=Diviners possesses the ability to tap into the mystical energies of the universe, wielding them to protect and aid other players in need.





origins.race.scout.name=Falconeers to nieustraszeni ścieżki, którzy wyruszają w niebo, ślizgając się po zdradzieckim terenie i odkrywając pozycje wroga przed rozpoczęciem bitwy. With unyielding momentum and high agility, they are the wind before the storm.


origins.race.attacker.name=Miecznicy uderzają śmiertelną prędkością i precyzją, teleportować się po polu bitwy i uwalniając niszczycielskie salwy ataków dystansowych i w zwarciu. Their job is simple—eliminate the threat before it reaches your allies.


origins.race.defender.name=Guardians are titans who leap into danger, slamming down with force and shielding their allies with sheer resilience. With iron skin and unmatched fortitude, they are the wall that no foe crosses.


origins.race.supporter.name=Sages channel celestial energy to shield, empower, and sustain their allies. Their aura transforms the tide of battle—granting strength, invincibility, and hope to their team in the darkest moments.


origins.race.rogue.name=Nightblades vanish in the blink of an eye, striking from unseen places and bending the battlefield in their favor. Masters of deception and sabotage, they thrive in chaos—crippling enemies and guiding victory from the shadows.


origins.class.caver.name=Cavers thrive underground, sensing ores, mining endlessly, and falling without fear. In the deep, they see what others miss.


origins.class.carpenter.name=Carpenters leap higher, build faster, and trade smarter. With reach and resilience, they shape the world with ease.


origins.class.shepherd.name=Shepherds grow and gather with care. Their presence feeds life, doubles harvests, and calls animals to their side.
origins.class.shepherd.description=Rzemieślnik





origins.class.random.name=You'll be assigned to a random available class.
origins.class.random.description=Przygłup
origins.class.random.description_changed=Nitwits aren't really good at anything. You'll continue with no additional traits.
origins.class.nitwit.name=Wojownik
origins.class.nitwit.description=These honorable fighters have the great courage to take down their foes.
origins.class.warrior.name=Łucznik
origins.class.warrior.description=One shot, one kill. Capable of taking down targets over a great distance.
origins.class.archer.name=Łobuz
origins.class.archer.description=Usually known to be thieves and robbers, rogues are proficient in ambushes and stealth attacks.
origins.class.rogue.name=Beastmaster
origins.class.rogue.description=Beastmasters are solitary people who prefer the company of animals.
origins.class.beastmaster.name=Kowal
origins.class.beastmaster.description=Valued friends of anyone, Blacksmiths are able to create better tools, weapons and armor.
origins.class.blacksmith.name=Duchowny
origins.class.blacksmith.description=They have learned how to channel the magic present in the world and use that to their advantage.
origins.class.cleric.name=Kucharz
origins.class.cleric.description=There is no one better to prepare your food other than a Cook.
origins.class.cook.name=Rolnik
origins.class.cook.description=Farmers have been known to provide everyone with food for as long as anyone can remember.
origins.class.farmer.name=Kupiec
origins.class.farmer.description=Always looking for an additional emerald, Merchants are proficient traders.
origins.class.merchant.name=Farmer
origins.class.merchant.description=Making the most of animals, Ranchers are able to gather many useful resources.
origins.class.rancher.name=Górnik
origins.class.rancher.description=Miners are the most proficient at digging up the earth's treasures.
origins.class.miner.name=Drwal
origins.class.miner.description=Trees should watch out when Lumberjacks are around.
origins.class.lumberjack.name=Odkrywca
origins.class.lumberjack.description=Explorers find their way through the most difficult terrain easily and discover hidden landmarks.

origins.class.explorer.description=Origin Traits:

origins.trait.has=You can breathe underwater, but not on land. Status effects such as water breathing, however, may help you in your ventures.
origins.trait.water_breathing.name=Aqua Affinity
origins.trait.water_breathing.description=You may break blocks underwater as others do on land, and be able to see perfectly underwater.
origins.trait.aqua_affinity.name=Sea Inhabitant
origins.trait.aqua_affinity.description=Underwater mobs wont naturally harm nor attack you, unless if you attack them first.
origins.trait.sea_creature.name=Like Water
origins.trait.sea_creature.description=You naturally stay afloat on the water, and sink by sneaking whenever you want to.
origins.trait.like_water.name=Ocean's Gift
origins.trait.like_water.description=You are invulnerable from damage dealt by tridents.
origins.trait.no_trident_damage.name=Kruchy
origins.trait.no_trident_damage.description=You have 3 less hearts of health than humans.
origins.trait.fragile.name=Taśma tapicerska
origins.trait.fragile.description=When you hit an enemy in melee, they get temporarily stuck in a cobweb, and further slows and poisons the target. Has a 13-second cooldown.
origins.trait.webbing.name=Web Cocoon
origins.trait.webbing.description=As long as you're standing in a cobweb, you mitigate any damage taken.
origins.trait.master_of_webs.name=Wspinaczka
origins.trait.master_of_webs.description=You are able to climb up any solid block you look at quickly by holding the jump button. Falling off while climbing mitigates fall damage received.
origins.trait.climbing.name=Carnivore
origins.trait.climbing.description=Your diet is restricted to meat, and you won't be able to eat nor interact with vegetable consumables.
origins.trait.carnivore.name=Nieprzepuszczalny
origins.trait.carnivore.description=Ilekroć bierzesz obrażenia magmy, ognia lub lawy, straciłeś zdrowie, zostanie natychmiast przywrócone i tymczasowo zwiększa wyrządzone szkody.
origins.trait.fire_immunity.name=Nether Inhabitant
origins.trait.fire_immunity.description=Your natural spawn will be in the Nether.
origins.trait.nether_spawn.name=Niedopałek
origins.trait.nether_spawn.description=When you are on fire, any mob that you hit and the mobs around it will be ignited and be set on fire. This can only be triggered once every 3 seconds.
origins.trait.burning_wrath.name=Hotblooded
origins.trait.burning_wrath.description=Due to your hot body, venoms burn up, making you immune to poison and hunger status effects.
origins.trait.hotblooded.name=Wodowstręt
origins.trait.hotblooded.description=You receive damage over time while in contact with water.
origins.trait.water_vulnerability.name=Tailwind
origins.trait.water_vulnerability.description=You are a little bit quicker on foot than others, while also being able to sprint more efficiently.
origins.trait.tailwind.name=Waga piórkowa
origins.trait.tailwind.description=You fall as gently to the ground as a feather would.
origins.trait.slow_falling.name=Wegetariański
origins.trait.slow_falling.description=Your diet is restricted to vegetables, and you won't be able to eat nor interact with meat consumables.
origins.trait.vegetarian.name=Fresh Air
origins.trait.vegetarian.description=When sleeping, your bed needs to be at an altitude of at least 70 blocks, so you can breathe fresh air.
origins.trait.fresh_air.name=You need to sleep at an altitude of at least 70 blocks
origins.trait.fresh_air.description=Phantomize
origins.trait.fresh_air.sleep_fail=Use the ability item to turn into spectator mode. You exit this state when you stand still.
origins.trait.phantomize.name=Spiritual Body
origins.trait.phantomize.description=While in spectator mode, you are invisible from others and can traverse through blocks, and you will be unable to interact with anything else.
origins.trait.invisibility.name=Undead
origins.trait.invisibility.description=You begin to burn in daylight if you are not invisible or in water. Headwear reduces sunlight damage by 50%.
origins.trait.burns_in_daylight.name=Strong Ankles
origins.trait.burns_in_daylight.description=You never take fall damage, no matter from which height you fall.

origins.trait.fall_immunity.description=Nine Lives

origins.trait.nine_lives.name=Weak Arms
origins.trait.nine_lives.description=When not under the effect of strength, you mine blocks slower and attack weaker.
origins.trait.weak_arms.name=Catlike Appearance
origins.trait.weak_arms.description=Creepers are scared of you and will only explode if you attack them first.





origins.trait.claustrophobia.name=Brittle Bones
origins.trait.claustrophobia.description=You take more damage from falling and flying into blocks.
origins.trait.more_kinetic_damage.name=Aerial Combatant
origins.trait.more_kinetic_damage.description=You deal more damage as you glide with an Elytra.

origins.trait.aerial_combatant.description=Scared of Gourds

origins.trait.pumpkin_hate.name=Familiar Face
origins.trait.pumpkin_hate.description=Monsters and other endermans won't attack you even if you look directly at them without wearing a carved pumpkin, unless you attack them first.
origins.trait.familiar_face.name=Hoarder
origins.trait.familiar_face.description=Trigger the ability to switch to a different inventory space. Allowing you to store more items with 9 additional slots which are kept even upon death.
origins.trait.shulk_inventory.name=Shulk Inventory
origins.trait.shulk_inventory.description=Sturdy Skin
origins.trait.shulk_inventory.label=Even without wearing armor, your skin provides natural protection thus receiving 20% less damage from any source.
origins.trait.natural_armor.name=Large Appetite
origins.trait.natural_armor.description=You easily get exhausted, depleting more hunger than normal.
origins.trait.more_exhaustion.name=Nieporęczny
origins.trait.more_exhaustion.description=The way your hands are formed provide no way of holding a shield upright. Attempting to block with a shield will immediately break it regardless of enchantments applied to it.
origins.trait.no_shield.name=Strong Arms
origins.trait.no_shield.description=You are stronger and can break stone blocks without requiring any pickaxe.
origins.trait.strong_arms.name=End Inhabitant
origins.trait.strong_arms.description=Your journey begins in the End.
origins.trait.end_spawn.name=Fast-footed
origins.trait.end_spawn.description=Due to your shorter legs and low exhaustion, your movement speed is increased and your size is decreased.
origins.trait.fast_footed.name=Pazur
origins.trait.fast_footed.description=Charge the ability item by holding it and leap into the direction you are looking at. The more the charge, the greater the distance will be.
origins.trait.pounce.name=Berry Craver
origins.trait.pounce.description=Sweet berries restores more hunger points when eaten, and would sometimes grant regeneration effects. You are also not damaged from berry bushes.
origins.trait.berry_craver.name=Smaller Heart
origins.trait.berry_craver.description=Due to your overall smaller size, your heart is smaller, resulting in your maximum health being lowered by 4 hearts.
origins.trait.smaller_heart.name=Fast Metabolism
origins.trait.smaller_heart.description=With your speed, and a smaller stomach, you get more hungry than usual.
origins.trait.fast_metabolism.name=Bouncy Body
origins.trait.fast_metabolism.description=You mitigate a great portion of fall damage due to your bouncy yet sticky body.
origins.trait.bouncy_body.name=Super Jump
origins.trait.bouncy_body.description=Your slime heritage gives you an improved leap, allowing you to jump higher. Knocking back and dealing damage to nearby mobs upon landing. This passive ability can only be triggerd once every 3 seconds.
origins.trait.high_jump.name=Lepki
origins.trait.high_jump.description=Any entity that attacks you in melee gets slowed, and reduces the damage inflicted to you by 10%. You also look green and slimy.
origins.trait.sticky.name=Podział
origins.trait.sticky.description=You shrink to a portion of your size as your health falls, as well as your maximum health points. 
origins.trait.fragmentation.name=Powrót do zdrowia
origins.trait.fragmentation.description=You can consume and eat slime balls to recover a lost portion of yourself.
origins.trait.slime_ball_consume.name=Stres
origins.trait.slime_ball_consume.description=This accumulates throughout you at a slow rate. Once it's filled up, you will violently explode - damaging everything that surrounds you. However, all of your abilities' cools down faster if your [Stress] is at 70%.
origins.trait.stress.name=Medytować
origins.trait.stress.description=Diminish the [Stress] accumulated by sneaking, for as long as you are on full health.
origins.trait.meditate.name=Cosmic Gift
origins.trait.meditate.description=Starbornes are beings blessed by the skies. Affected by less gravity, you are able to jump higher and descend back to the ground with grace - taking no fall damage whatsoever.
origins.trait.cosmic_gift.name=Hyper Leap
origins.trait.cosmic_gift.description=Propel towards a certain direction you are looking at, and launching entities you were in into air. Has a short cooldown before each use.
origins.trait.hyper_leap.name=Spadająca gwiazda
origins.trait.hyper_leap.description=Fires a star projectile towards the direction you are looking at, damaging mobs on impact. Has a cooldown before each use.
origins.trait.shooting_star.name=Nonviolent
origins.trait.shooting_star.description=Starbornes have a chance of becoming temporarily immobilized whenever they are harmed by another entity. In this state, your vision is also temporarily hindered.
origins.trait.no_hitting.name=Cold Vacuum
origins.trait.no_hitting.description=Starbornes are used to the coldness of the vast cosmos, therefore taking twice the fire damage - heat that they're not used to.
origins.trait.burning.name=Zwinny
origins.trait.burning.description=Inchlings are immune to thorns and velocity-based damage.
origins.trait.nimble.name=Hyper-active
origins.trait.nimble.description=You are able to consume sugar even if you're full, granting a temporary movement speed boost.
origins.trait.hyper_active.name=Small Apetite
origins.trait.hyper_active.description=Consuming sugar is enough for your needs, as it is gives long-lasting saturation effects to you. Requiring less food to keep going.
origins.trait.small_apetite.name=Bite-sized
origins.trait.small_apetite.description=You are many times smaller and have 5 less hearts compared to that of a regular human.
origins.trait.bite_sized.name=Trujący
origins.trait.bite_sized.description=When you deal crit damage, inflicts fatal poison to the target that lasts 7 seconds. Then, reduces the [Stinger] count by one. This ability will not trigger on entities that already have the effect.
origins.trait.poisonous.name=Śmiertelność
origins.trait.poisonous.description=You deal 50% more damage to targets you hurt afflicted with fatal poison.
origins.trait.poison_bonus_damage.name=Stingers
origins.trait.poison_bonus_damage.description=You carry up to 7 stingers at a time, and is used each time you inflict poison damage. Once all stingers are used up, you are bound to perish and die.
origins.trait.sacrifice_stinger.name=Pollenate
origins.trait.sacrifice_stinger.description=During the day, you can stand on any flower and sneak to recover any [Stinger] you may have lost. However, this will break the flower.
origins.trait.bloom.name=Dzienny
origins.trait.bloom.description=You work best in a sunny day, thus you are weakened and move slow at night or if it starts raining during the day.
origins.trait.nighttime.name=Short Lifespan
origins.trait.nighttime.description=Bees have 3 less hearts than humans.
origins.trait.lifespan.name=Nectar Diet
origins.trait.lifespan.description=You can not eat normal food, and only be able to consume flowers.
origins.trait.nectar_diet.name=Duma
origins.trait.nectar_diet.description=The more gold items you carry in your inventory, worn, or held, the less damage you'll receive from any source. You can mitigate up to 90% of damage received this way.
origins.trait.pride.name=Boasting Firepower
origins.trait.pride.description=Your melee attack inflicts additional damage equivalent to 10% of the damage you've dealt. Further increases the additional damage dealt by 10% per nearby entities present within 6 blocks.
origins.trait.increased_attack_per_entity.name=Obżarstwo
origins.trait.increased_attack_per_entity.description=You get even more hungry than usual when replenishing health.
origins.trait.gluttony.name=Odwaga
origins.trait.gluttony.description=You are immune from weakness and wither status effects.
origins.trait.courage.name=Lifeweaver
origins.trait.courage.description=Immediately regenerates health based on the accumulated damage taken within 3 seconds upon receiving it. Then, grants absorption for 12 seconds that scales depending on the amount of damage received.
origins.trait.lifeweaver.name=Szybki
origins.trait.lifeweaver.description=Become nimble and swift, granting you increased movement speed, enabling you to traverse the terrain effortlessly.
origins.trait.agility.name=Belzebub
origins.trait.agility.description=Melee attacks will deal additional damage based on your missing health. Then, charges one stack of [Beelzebub] on attack, up to three.
origins.trait.beelzebub.name=Soulburst
origins.trait.beelzebub.description=Kiedy [BEELZEBUB] osiągnie trzy stosy, zużywa to wszystkie i zadaje dodatkowe szkody w oparciu o całkowitą obrażenia zadane podczas pozyskiwania stosów.
origins.trait.soulburst.name=Umbral Veil
origins.trait.soulburst.description=Shrouds yourself in a dark energy when sprinting, granting additional speed and avoiding any projectile damage.
origins.trait.umbral_veil.name=Sinister Aura
origins.trait.umbral_veil.description=Nearby passive mobs are frightened with your presence, and will run away from you.
origins.trait.sinister_aura.name=Life Drain
origins.trait.sinister_aura.description=Whenever you deal damage, your health is reduced by the target's missing health, up to 50% of your max health. When your health is equal to 1, this will not reduce any further.
origins.trait.life_drain.name=Przewidywanie
origins.trait.life_drain.description=Punch with the ability selected to cast onto another player. Upon cast, increases both you and the other player's max health by 50% to 60% of both of your health combined.
origins.trait.prescience.name=Wyrocznia
origins.trait.prescience.description=When under [Prescience], any damage you take and healing received will be blasted to the other player.
origins.trait.oracle.name=Egida
origins.trait.oracle.description=Any external damage taken directly will deflect 50% of the damage back to the attacker.
origins.trait.aegis.name=Divine Aura
origins.trait.aegis.description=Players under the effect of [Prescience] will glow, and can be seen through walls. However, this glow will always persist on you.
origins.trait.divine_aura.name=Kruchość
origins.trait.divine_aura.description=The less health you have, the more susceptible you are from any damage.
origins.trait.fragility.name=Niestabilność
origins.trait.fragility.description=W przypadku każdego unikalnego efektu statusu zastosowanego do Ciebie, twoje Max Health zostanie zmniejszone o 1. Gdy twoje zdrowie będzie równe 1, nie zmniejszy to żadnego.

origins.trait.instability.description=Class Perks:

origins.perk.has=In the Shadows

origins.perk.stealth.name=Zwinność
origins.perk.stealth.description=You can move quicker on foot than others while drawing your bow or crossbow.
origins.perk.less_bow_slowdown.name=Precyzja
origins.perk.less_bow_slowdown.description=All arrows you shoot travels in a straight line, affected by no gravity.
origins.perk.no_projectile_divergence.name=Shield Wield
origins.perk.no_projectile_divergence.description=You get additional protection when blocking yourself with a shield.
origins.perk.less_shield_slowdown.name=Wrath Bloodlust
origins.perk.less_shield_slowdown.description=You gain strength that increases the lower your current health is.
origins.perk.less_health_more_attack.name=Fauna Friends
origins.perk.less_health_more_attack.description=Animals you tame receive a permanent buff to their health.
origins.perk.tamed_animal_boost.name=Effective Empathy
origins.perk.tamed_animal_boost.description=Any potion effects you may have will also be applied to the mobs you've tamed.
origins.perk.effective_empathy.name=Good Meals
origins.perk.effective_empathy.description=Foods you cook will grant additional saturation when eaten.
origins.perk.more_saturated_food.name=Rejuvenating Soup
origins.perk.more_saturated_food.description=Stews you make can grant regeneration effects.
origins.perk.better_stew.name=Proficient Brewing
origins.perk.better_stew.description=By extending the length of potion effects using redstone, any potion you brew will be further extended.
origins.perk.longer_potions.name=Potent Brews
origins.perk.longer_potions.description=Any potion you brew will be more amplified when brewing it with glowstone.
origins.perk.powerful_potions.name=Great Craftsmanship
origins.perk.powerful_potions.description=Any equipment you craft or smith will have increased durability, efficiency, damage, and maybe even Fortune I.
origins.perk.quality_equipment.name=Efficient Repairs
origins.perk.quality_equipment.description=High-quality equipments you have crafted are easily more repairable and can restore more durability points.
origins.perk.efficient_repairs.name=Green Thumb
origins.perk.efficient_repairs.description=When planting crops, there is a chance it will immediately grow.
origins.perk.fast_crop_growth.name=Bountiful Harvest
origins.perk.fast_crop_growth.description=When harvesting crops, you sometimes receive twice the yield.
origins.perk.more_crop_drops.name=More Births
origins.perk.more_crop_drops.description=Animals bred when you are around have a chance to produce multiple babies.
origins.perk.twin_breeding.name=Scavenging
origins.perk.twin_breeding.description=You are able to sometimes receive more material from killing mobs.
origins.perk.more_animal_loot.name=Great Deals
origins.perk.more_animal_loot.description=You get discounts when trading with villagers.
origins.perk.cheaper_trades.name=Charyzma
origins.perk.cheaper_trades.description=Wandering Traders are more likely to visit when you are around.
origins.perk.wandering_trader_spawn.name=Pasować
origins.perk.wandering_trader_spawn.description=You do not lose hunger when sprinting.
origins.perk.no_sprint_exhaustion.name=Explorer Kit
origins.perk.no_sprint_exhaustion.description=You start the game with a compass, a clock and nine empty maps that will never drop on death.

origins.perk.explorer_kit.description=Tree Capitator

origins.perk.tree_felling.name=Replanting
origins.perk.tree_felling.description=There's a chance logs you break may be replanted with the same type of sapling.

