origins.trait.launch_into_air.name=Skrzydlaty
origins.trait.launch_into_air.description=You have Elytra wings without needing to equip any, and is never lost nor can be removed.
origins.trait.elytra.name=Elementy zasadnicze
origins.trait.elytra.description=You retain access to essential inventory, ensuring your hotbar is not lost upon death.
origins.trait.essentials.name=Szybki
origins.trait.essentials.description=Become nimble and swift, granting you increased movement speed, enabling you to traverse the terrain effortlessly.
origins.trait.swift.name=Akrobatyka
origins.trait.swift.description=With powerful legs, leap 2 blocks high while sprinting — crush obstacles and evade danger with ease.
origins.trait.sprint_jump.name=Lightweight
origins.trait.sprint_jump.description=Fall like a feather: take no fall damage, never tire from sprinting or jumping, but beware — other attacks hurt 10% more.

origins.trait.lightweight.description=Teleportation

origins.trait.throw_ender_pearl.name=No room to teleport there!
origins.trait.throw_ender_pearl.description=Endless Quiver
origins.trait.throw_ender_pearl.failed=Your arrows never run dry. Wield your bow with infinite ammo and relentless precision.
origins.trait.endless_quiver.name=Snajper
origins.trait.endless_quiver.description=Deal 30% more damage with ranged attacks. Your aim is death’s own messenger.
origins.trait.marksman.name=Okrutny
origins.trait.marksman.description=Unleash primal fury. Gain Strength I and crush enemies in close quarters.
origins.trait.ferocious.name=Kruchy
origins.trait.ferocious.description=Power comes at a price — take 20% more damage from entity attacks. Be swift, not reckless.




origins.trait.smash.name=Trudny
origins.trait.smash.description=Grow 4 bonus hearts and gain 20% resistance to all forms of damage. You are the frontline.
origins.trait.tough.name=Unbreakable Skin
origins.trait.tough.description=Deflect the skies — take 30% less damage from projectiles. Arrows bounce off your iron resolve.
origins.trait.unbreakable_skin.name=Ociężałość
origins.trait.unbreakable_skin.description=Massive power weighs heavy. Move 5% slower and exhaust twice as fast — but your might is unmatched.

origins.trait.heavy.description=Empowering Aura

origins.trait.empowering_aura.name=⚠ Aura on cooldown!
origins.trait.empowering_aura.description=Długowieczność
origins.trait.empowering_aura.cooldown=Gain 2 extra hearts and outlast your enemies. Every breath is a second chance.
origins.trait.longevity.name=Good Memory
origins.trait.longevity.description=Your inventory returns with you from the grave. Death is merely a setback.
origins.trait.good_memory.name=Hunger Resistance
origins.trait.good_memory.description=Endure the wild. Reduce exhaustion by 20% from all activities and stay full longer.
origins.trait.hunger_resistant.name=Hunger Aura
origins.trait.hunger_resistant.description=Empower your allies: All players within 16 blocks gain Hunger Resistance just by being near you.




origins.trait.invisibility.name=⚠ Invisibility on cooldown!
origins.trait.invisibility.description=⚠ Cannot use invisibility while hindered!
origins.trait.invisibility.cooldown=Nocny
origins.trait.invisibility.hindered=At places where the light level is low, you automatically get the strength and night vision status effects.
origins.trait.cat_vision.name=Kamuflaż
origins.trait.cat_vision.description=You blend in with the environment when you're sneaking, that hostile mobs wont naturally attack you - unless if you attack them first.
origins.trait.camouflage.name=Podstępny
origins.trait.camouflage.description=Your nameplate is never always visible, even when you're not sneaking.
origins.trait.sneaky.name=Debilitating Strikes
origins.trait.sneaky.description=Cripple your enemies. Any mob you hit is slowed for 4 seconds — they’ll never escape your wrath.
origins.trait.debilitating_strikes.name=Mniejszy
origins.trait.debilitating_strikes.description=Your size is reduced 25%, making you harder to target.
origins.trait.smaller.name=Need for Mobility
origins.trait.smaller.description=Heavy armor slows you by 50%. You were made for speed, not slugging it out in steel.




origins.perk.ore_vein_miner.name=Veteran Excavator
origins.perk.ore_vein_miner.description=You do not lose hunger when mining.
origins.perk.no_mining_exhaustion.name=Blessed Miner
origins.perk.no_mining_exhaustion.description=You are blessed with Fortune +1 on whatever pickaxe you use. This blessing does not transfer to others.




origins.perk.fall_resistant.name=Builder’s Step
origins.perk.fall_resistant.description=You're trained to scale structures with ease, jumping twice as high to reach ledges and frames.

origins.perk.high_jumper.description=Prospector’s Intuition


